@startuml Linkwise_Agent_Session_Start
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
hide footbox
participant "ChatGPT Agent / Codex" as AI
participant "MCP adapter" as MCP
participant "Station execution" as APP
AI -> MCP: link_start_session(handle, grant, key)
MCP -> APP: revalidate; consume handles
APP -> APP: persist operation; adopt lease
APP --> MCP: operation_id / session_id
MCP --> AI: accepted, not connected
note over AI,APP: Accepted work outlives this individual MCP request
APP -> APP: local client / modem / PTT supervision
AI -> MCP: session / bounded events(cursor)
MCP -> APP: query authoritative state
APP --> MCP: progress / terminal reason / freshness
MCP --> AI: outcome and evidence level
note over APP
 Reconnect reads the same operation.
 Duplicate start key cannot create a second attempt.
end note
@enduml
